{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：12:17 2026-06-09 HKT<br/>發佈時間：12:17 2026-06-09 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：12:17 2026-06-09 HKT</p><p>荃灣中心一期於昨午（8日）發生總掣房電力系統故障，導致5幢大廈及商場停水停電，逾千戶居民受影響。事件擾攘近一日經緊急維修後，至今日（9日）早上近中午前，受影響的各幢大廈及商場終於恢復供電，所見大廈樓上住戶有燈，商戶亦陸續開舖做生意。</p><img alt=\"周二中午，荃灣中心一期恢復電力供應，樓上住戶有燈。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/860f3b1c6930a0eeeedb80ab5ee84d54/2026-06/1_2_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/337277deed23fa97e4437d907cbb2099/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-09_at_11_50_03.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"商戶在恢復供電後，開舖做生意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c72a3925695cc3995986e06bcc7af42e/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-09_at_11_31_04.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2e5e807b4ed7b6b29e73b31b46ff16ea/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-09_at_11_29_19.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e19f760831bc5f8d062eb0dad78f81f9/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-09_at_11_29_20.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bf1cc3d2dbe8dfdfd86bc38db4aeb82d/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-09_at_11_29_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4fc9fb8685c2928a182158c65585a3f4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-09_at_11_31_04_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-09T04:28:16.299742+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}